---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-bg" />
		<div class="hero-content">
			<h1>Núcleo Linux</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Comunidad de Software Libre y Código Abierto</p>
			<p class="location">Universidad Autónoma Gabriel René Moreno</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section" id="nosotros">
		<div class="content">
			<h2>¿Quiénes somos?</h2>
			<p>Núcleo Linux es la comunidad universitaria de software libre de la UAGRM. Promovemos el uso de GNU/Linux, el código abierto y la cultura del conocimiento compartido.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.hero {
		position: relative;
		height: 100vh;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		color: white;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.hero-bg {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e);
		z-index: -1;
	}
	.hero-bg::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(50, 50, 120, 0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);
	}
	.hero-content {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 0 20px;
	}
	.hero-content h1 {
		font-size: 4rem;
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.subtitle {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}
	.location {
		font-size: 1rem;
		opacity: 0.5;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.section {
		min-height: 60vh;
		padding: 120px 40px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}
	.content {
		max-width: 680px;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.content h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		color: #1a1a2e;
	}
	.content p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #555;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero-content h1 {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}
		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
